        "event": "Hydrologic Outlook",
        "headline": "Hydrologic Outlook issued June 22 at 1:52PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "ESFAFG\n\n...Locations Impacted...\nEastern Alaska Range South of Trims Camp-Northern Denali\nBorough-Southern Denali Borough-Eastern Alaska Range North of Trims\nCamp\n\nA front is expected to move westward over the state throughout the\nbeginning of this week. As this front progresses, we are expecting\nwidespread rain showers and thunderstorms to begin Tuesday morning\nfor the eastern Alaska Range and spread west by Tuesday afternoon\nduring the time of heaviest rainfall with totals as high as 1\" or\nmor",
        "severity": "Unknown",
        "certainty": "Possible",
        "urgency": "Future",
        "sender": "NWS Fairbanks AK",
